          "id": "article-1",
          "type": "article-card",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 0,
          "props": {
            "title": "Hey Bradley: The Origin Story",
            "image": "",
            "alt": "Bradley working on a whiteboard",
            "hook": "Ever felt like your best ideas get lost in translation from whiteboard to execution?",
            "problem": "I struggled with capturing the fluidity of thought in rigid digital tools, leading to creative blocks and lost momentum.",
            "resolution": "This led me to build Hey Bradley, a tool that brings your ideas to life as naturally as you conceive them.",
            "tags": [
              "Origin",
              "Vision",
              "Inspiration"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article-2",
          "type": "article-card",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 1,
          "props": {
            "title": "The Product Journey: From Idea to Interaction",
            "image": "",
            "alt": "Screenshot of Hey Bradley product interface",
            "hook": "Transforming a raw concept into a polished product requires more than just code; it demands a conversation.",
            "problem": "Many tools dictate how you work, forcing your creative process into their pre-defined boxes, stifling true innovation.",
            "resolution": "Hey Bradley was meticulously crafted to adapt to your workflow, providing an intuitive, conversational interface that builds with you.",
            "tags": [
              "Product",
              "Development",
              "UX"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "article-3",
          "type": "article-card",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 2,
          "props": {
            "title": "Capstone: Building the Future of Creative Flow",
            "image": "",
            "alt": "Bradley celebrating a product launch",
            "hook": "The journey doesn't end with a launch; it's a continuous evolution towards a more intuitive creative future.",
            "problem": "The digital landscape is littered with tools that solve immediate problems but fail to scale with growing ambitions or adapt to new challenges.",
            "resolution": "Hey Bradley's capstone isn't just a finished product; it's a living platform, constantly learning and evolving to keep pace with your wildest ideas.",
            "tags": [
              "Future",
              "Vision",
              "Innovation"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "content": {
        "heading": "The Story Behind Hey Bradley",
        "subheading": "Journey through the inception, creation, and future of a new kind of creative partner."
      }
