          "type": "text",
          "enabled": true,
          "order": 1,
          "props": {
            "text": "Bradley Ross is the creator of Hey Bradley and holds an ALM from Harvard University. With a passion for transforming complex ideas into intuitive digital experiences, Bradley's work focuses on empowering creators to build, ship, and grow their visions seamlessly. His journey from whiteboard concept to robust platform is driven by a belief in tools that listen and adapt to the human creative process."
          }
